  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "A brave Tanuki must battle the undead in an abandoned mansion to get his magic item back. The character has no weapon, so he must use his environment to progress. Le Manoir des Zombies is the small NES game demo from SJ Games (a 10 years old french kid) made in the context of the NESmaker Byte Off competition 2022."
    }
